# dependencies
node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js
# yarn.lock is the single source of truth (the VDS deploy runs
# `yarn install --frozen-lockfile`). A package-lock.json created by a stray local
# `npm install` must never be committed: it drifts from yarn.lock silently, and on
# a machine behind the corporate npm mirror its `resolved` URLs point at a host
# the VDS can't reach.
package-lock.json

